                          "rich_text": "<h4><span style=\"color: #8e992e; font-family: 'Wix Madefor Text'; font-weight: 800; font-style: normal;\">For your customers, shopping isn\u2019t just about a transaction. It's about an immersive experience with your brand. Your retail space is a significant factor in creating an overall customer experience.</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Keeping your locations up to standards that you and your customers both expect is key to driving your business.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><br></span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">With Vixxo\u2019s retail facilities expertise, you can consistently create exceptional experiences for all of your customers. Whether it\u2019s your HVAC, lighting, store exterior, signage or a special project you need for all your locations, our extensive network of service providers has you covered.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\"></span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">We keep your customers happy and your stores up and running, all while saving you time and money.<br></span></p>",
